{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/gettingstarted"]}],"metadata":{"title":"Getting Started","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentSheet"],"title":"Getting Started","anchor":"Getting-Started","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Integrating Mollie Components is three steps: add the package, present the sheet from your checkout screen with a server-issued client access token, and switch over the typed ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","isActive":true},{"text":" you get back. Card data the cardholder types stays inside Mollie’s UI and is tokenized over TLS — your code only ever sees session metadata.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires iOS 16.0+, Swift 5.9+, and Xcode 16+. It is distributed exclusively via Swift Package Manager.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"text":"Add the package","anchor":"Add-the-package","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In your ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/mollie\/mollie-components-ios\", from: \"0.1.0\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Or in Xcode: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"File → Add Package Dependencies…"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", then paste the repository URL.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Merchants import only the umbrella module:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import MollieComponents"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The sub-modules (","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"MolliePayments","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"MolliePaymentsUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") are available for advanced integrations, but the entire merchant surface is reachable through ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" alone.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Present the sheet (UIKit)","anchor":"Present-the-sheet-UIKit","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentSheet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" exposes a single static, ","type":"text"},{"code":"async","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entry point. Pass the view controller to present from and the client access token your backend minted for this session; ","type":"text"},{"code":"await","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the terminal outcome:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import MollieComponents","","let result = await MolliePaymentSheet.present(","    from: viewController,","    clientToken: clientToken",")","","switch result {","case .completed(let payment):","    \/\/ Success — reconcile against your backend using payment.sessionToken","    break","case .failed(let error):","    \/\/ Map the error to merchant-facing UI — see <doc:HandlingErrors>","    break","case .cancelled:","    \/\/ The cardholder dismissed the sheet — not an error","    break","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"theme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter is optional and defaults to Mollie branding. To restyle the sheet, pass a custom theme — see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Present inline (SwiftUI)","anchor":"Present-inline-SwiftUI","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For SwiftUI hosts you have two options. Use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"molliePaymentSheet(isPresented:clientToken:theme:endpoints:onResult:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier to drive a modal from a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bool","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" binding:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import MollieComponents","import SwiftUI","","struct CheckoutScreen: View {","    @State private var isPaying = false","    let clientToken: String","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Pay\") { isPaying = true }","            .molliePaymentSheet(isPresented: $isPaying, clientToken: clientToken) { result in","                switch result {","                case .completed(let payment): break","                case .failed(let error): break","                case .cancelled: break","                }","            }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Or embed the card form directly in your layout with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentCardFormView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — no modal, the form’s own “Pay with card” button is the call to action:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["MolliePaymentCardFormView(clientToken: clientToken) { result in","    \/\/ Same MolliePaymentResult, fired exactly once","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Handle the result","anchor":"Handle-the-result","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every entry point resolves to the same ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/completed(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" carries a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sessionToken"},{"type":"text","text":" you use to reconcile server-side."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/failed(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" carries the failure. Map it to your own localized UI — the full catalog of causes and recommended actions is in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" means the cardholder dismissed the flow. This is a normal terminal state, "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" an error."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Next steps","anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text